{
  "_comment": "A Fang-format auto-tile. The sheet is ONE TILE WIDE and FIVE TILES TALL: the five bands are, top to bottom, outer corner / vertical edge / horizontal edge / inner corner / fill. tileSize and frames are left out deliberately - they are worked out from the image, so there is only one description of them. See engine/include/engine/tilemap/AutoTile.h.",
